      <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, lineHeight: 1.4, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.6)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif" }}>Negamax + α/β 剪枝：搜索宽度从 b^d 降到约 b^(d/2)</Text>
