      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.8)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>Negamax：己方取最大、对方取最小，用同一套递归写双方。</Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: "row", alignItems: "flex-start", gap: 12, marginBottom: 13 }}>
      <Box style={{ width: 7, height: 7, borderRadius: 2, background: "#B3271E", marginTop: 9 }} />
      <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, lineHeight: 1.64, color: "rgba(42,33,24,0.8)", fontFamily: "'PingFang SC', 'Microsoft YaHei', sans-serif", flex: 1 }}>α/β 剪枝：一旦证明某分支不可能更好，立即整枝放弃。</Text>
